# "Solved - [triggered ability]" means "This ability triggers only if this Case is solved" (CR 702.169c): asked as it
# triggers and never again. Bot1's Case of the Crimson Pulse is solved on turn 1 (an empty hand at its end step). At the
# turn-3 upkeep its Solved ability triggers; with it on the stack Bot2 flashes in Cathar Commando and sacrifices it to destroy
# the Case. The ability still resolves: the (empty) hand is discarded and two cards drawn, then the draw step's card: three.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Case of the Crimson Pulse
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Cathar Commando
Island x20

